description:
Create a terminal session for a working directory.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__paseo__create_terminal(args: {
  // Optional working directory. Defaults to your current working directory.
  cwd?: string;
  // Optional terminal name.
  name?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

List terminals for a working directory or across all working directories.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__paseo__list_terminals(args: {
  // List terminals across all working directories.
  all?: boolean;
  // Optional working directory. Defaults to your current working directory.
  cwd?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

